  "description": "REFURBISHMENT OF THE EXISTING CHANGING ROOMS, ALTERATIONS TO\r\nTHE EXISTING REDUNDANT CHANGING ROOMS TO CREATE NEW PLANT ROOMS AND AN\r\nACCESSIBLE STAFF CHANGING ROOM. REFURBISHMENT TO THE SWIMMING POOL TANK AND\r\nRAISING OF THE EXISTING ROOF TO ACCOMMODATE A LEVEL ACCESS BETWEEN THE NEW\r\nACCESSIBLE STAFF CHANGING ROOM AND THE SWIMMING POOL AREA. MINOR EXTERNAL WORKS\r\nTO PATHS.",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Hillside",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:30:30.195Z",
  "street_name": "EDGE HILL",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">External Materials as Specified</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials to be used for the\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be those specified in the application form\r\nunless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policies D4 and D8 of the London Plan 2021, policies D12.1\r\nand D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><s></s></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;-&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;The following measures should be implemented\r\nwithin the development to reduce impacts on foraging and commuting bats caused\r\nby artificial lighting (BCT &amp;amp; ILP, 2023):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;• Direct any task lighting used\r\nduring construction away from boundary vegetation and any trees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 2.25pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Set any\r\nnecessary security lighting on short timers with a sensitivity to large moving\r\nobjects only;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 2.25pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;• Consider installing internal\r\nlight fittings in a recess were installed in proximity &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; to windows facing the boundary vegetation in order to\r\nreduce glare and light spill;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;• Limit lighting times to provide dark\r\nperiods;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;• LED light sources should be\r\nused wherever possible due to their sharp cut-off, lower intensity, good colour\r\nrendition and dimming capabilities. A warm spectrum light (ideally&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Reason:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;To mitigate\r\nagainst any harm to commuting bats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">3372/3/SD01, 3372/SD05, 3372/SD06, 3372/SD08, 3372/SD10 &amp; 3372/SD11</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Noise Levels</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - Expressed as the equivalent continuous sound\r\nlevel) LAeq (15 minutes), from the new mechanical plant/air conditioning shall\r\nnot exceed LA90-10bB at the boundary with any residential property. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To safeguard\r\nthe amenities of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply with the\r\nfollowing Development Plan policies for Merton policy D14 of the London Plan\r\n2021 and policies D12.1 and D12.4 of the Local Plan 2024.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;-&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The advice and recommendations contained within the submitted “Heyda\r\nAcoustics” Plant Noise Impact Assessment dated 17&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; April 2026 must\r\nbe implemented and maintained as advised.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-indent: 36pt;&quot;&gt;Reason:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To\r\nmitigate the impact of plant noise on neighbouring amenity&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;-&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The applicant should provide\r\nan updated drainage layout which incorporates flow routes and details of the\r\nproposed ACO drains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reason:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: 36pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To safeguard against surface\r\nwater flooding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;!--StartFragment--&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;No works—including site clearance, demolition, or bringing machinery/materials onto the site—may legally begin until the protective fencing is erected around the canopy spread and root protection areas of surrounding trees and/or approved in writing by the local planning authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reason: To safeguard nearby trees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--EndFragment--&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
